	 * by _next() and _destroy() (vma_end_read, bpf_iter_mmput_async)
	 * can take spinlocks with IRQs disabled (pi_lock, pool->lock).
	 * Running from NMI or from a tracepoint that fires with those
	 * locks held could deadlock.
